Hei!

324
00:25:55,554 --> 00:25:58,182
"Aku melihat monster."

325
00:25:58,224 --> 00:26:00,559
Seseorang meninggal dunia.
Ini bukan lelucon.

326
00:26:01,710 --> 00:26:03,562
Emerson?

327
00:26:03,587 --> 00:26:05,063
- Abby!
- Aku mau bicara...

328
00:26:05,088 --> 00:26:06,523
- Serius?
- Ya.

329
00:26:06,548 --> 00:26:09,843
Astaga. Pastor Carl
memang menyebalkan.

330
00:26:11,679 --> 00:26:14,699
- Ayo pergi dari sini.
- Aku mau, tapi tidak bisa.

331
00:26:15,307 --> 00:26:17,868
Tentu saja kau bisa. Ayo.

332
00:26:18,352 --> 00:26:21,330
Itu informasi rahasia.

333
00:26:21,397 --> 00:26:22,623
Apa?

334
00:26:22,648 --> 00:26:24,625
Sekarang mereka semua
menganggap aku gila.

335
00:26:24,650 --> 00:26:26,711
